The Point is a animation, family, fantasy film directed by Fred Wolf.

2
00:08:13,333 --> 00:08:19,333
Years ago, there was a place called The Land of Point, because everything in The Land of
Point had one: the barns, the houses, the cars, everything, even the people.

3
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:26,000
Everyone in The Land of Point had a point at the top of its head.

4
00:16:26,666 --> 00:16:32,666
Everyone, that is, except Oblio, who was born round-headed.

5
00:20:33,333 --> 00:20:39,333
Since he had no point, Oblio, along with his trusty dog,
Arrow, was banished to the Pointless Forest.

6
00:24:40,000 --> 00:24:46,000
Join them to see what wonders await these two intrepid travelers as they make
their way on their amazing, song-filled journey of discovery!

